{"id":"SNIP_det_AUTOSAR_SWS_CANI_P144_159","src":"snippet","doc":"AUTOSAR_SWS_CANInterface","page":144,"text":"The former request\nCan_SetControllerMode()\nreturns and\ninforms CanIf about a successful request which in turn returns the\nupper layer request\nCanIf_SetControllerMode()\n. The\nCan_MainFunction_Mode()\ndetects the successful mode\ntransition of the CAN controller and inform the CanIf\nasynchronously via\nCanIf_ControllerModeIndication\n(Controller, CAN_CS_STARTED)\n.","caption":"","sha":null,"series":[],"releases":[],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.9,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"Specification of service CanIf_SetControllerMode","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00003"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.9,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"Specification of CanIf_ControllerModeIndication","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00699"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"CanIf_SetControllerMode calling Can_SetControllerMode","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00308"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.8,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"Can_SetControllerMode transitions controller states","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CP_CAN_00003"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"}